  "description": "\\*\\*Original Webtoon:\\*\\* \\[Lezhin\\](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/love\\_is\\_pouring\\_in), \\[Bomtoon\\](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/love\\_is\\_po/), \\[MrBlue\\](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt\\_000056010), \\[Naver Series\\](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9504234), \\[KakaoPage\\](https://page.kakao.com/content/63068724), \\[Ridibooks\\](https://ridibooks.com/books/4419007282) A world where teenagers cannot feel love due to . Growing up watching his parents' fight, \"Ido\" is grateful to the world and hopes not to become an adult. But why... Does the crying face of a transfer student who was not interested keep coming to mind? A curse-like feeling that came to Lee Do, who hated love. His grim story begins.",
